TITLE Calcite kinetics in acidic solution at 200C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH   2
    pe   4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu   10
    Ba   5
    Cl   30 charge
    -water 1

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0    1
        -m     1
        -parms 1.0  10
        -tol   1e-12
    -steps 1000 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -time true
    -step true
    -totals Alkalinity
END
